{"term":"app di incontri","lang":"it","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"internet_subculture","subcategory":"casual_sex","concept":"hookup","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_neutral","crude":8,"technical":12,"recognition_pct_current":95,"recognition_pct_peak":95,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Italian phrase for a mobile application used to meet potential sexual or romantic partners, encompassing both dating-oriented apps and explicitly hookup-focused apps.","english_term":"dating app","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"Literal translation is 'meeting app'; mapped to hookup because in Italian popular discourse the sexual and casual-encounter use case dominates the term's connotations; 'app di appuntamenti' is a rarer alternative phrasing."}
